    "body": "fix on issue/3236-wire-iso-finite-words · PR #3263 · pinned by a_non_finite_wire_number_is_refused_by_name_and_writes_no_cut · merges when reviewed\n\nFinding: the post does not write `UNaN` or `ANaN`. The failure is silent. A non-finite WireU or WireAngle reached the script as `null` (or as the text `nan` / `inf`). The script skipped the param, and the leaning move posted as a plain `G1 X Y` with no refusal. The PR refuses each non-finite wire number by name and writes no cut of the section.\n",
